docs {
  # Lists all available ActiveGates

  **Deprecated**

  The response includes all ActiveGates that are currently connected to the environment or have been connected during last 2 hours. Deprecated since version 1.343. Use DQL Smartscape nodes to query ActiveGate data instead. See https://dt-url.net/mf03894

  **Auth:** OAuth (inherited from collection)

  **Required OAuth scopes:** `environment-api:activegates:read`, `fleet-management:activegates:read`

  **API token scopes:** activeGates.read
}
